{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:22 2026-10-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:22 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:22 2026-10-19 HKT</p><img alt=\"Facebook 車cam L（香港群組）影片截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c903a004e37f79af0310dd13dbb795b7/2026-10/2026-10-19_8_14_36.png\"/><p>屯門發生交通意外。今日（19日）早上6時12分，一輛私家車沿屯門公路往藍地方向行駛，駛至港鐵兆康站對開、近藍地交匯處時，懷疑失控撞向防撞欄後翻側，全車四輪朝天。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，男司機已自行爬出，他多處受傷，由救護車送院屯門醫院治理。警方正調查意外原因。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T00:29:39.456689+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T00:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T00:57:36.458085+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T00:28:30.982196+00:00","content_hash":"39d32741c63fe0343ff650773800a4bba60e94d85f0f2a285b577e6e5e4af3b1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}